---
source: src/main.rs
expression: "render_help_snapshot(&[\"share\", \"create\"])"
---
Create a public link for a captured request

Usage: hooklistener share create [OPTIONS] <REQUEST_ID>

Arguments:
  <REQUEST_ID>  Captured request ID (from `endpoint list-requests`)

Options:
      --expires-in <DURATION>  Link lifetime in whole hours, such as 24h, 86400, or 7d
      --password <PASSWORD>    Password required to open the link
      --include-forwards       Include forwards in the shared view
  -o, --org <ORG_ID>           Organization ID (overrides the configured default)
  -h, --help                   Print help

Global options:
      --json               Output supported command responses or event streams as JSON
      --color <COLOR>      Styling policy for human output [default: auto] [possible values: auto,
                           always, never]
      --yes                Confirm destructive commands without an interactive prompt
      --log-level <LEVEL>  Log level [default: info] [possible values: trace, debug, info, warn,
                           error]
      --log-dir <DIR>      Directory for log files
      --log-stdout         Also write logs to stdout
